## 6. DSO-304 — Multi-stage Build: Frontend

### Objective

Build the frontend using Vite and serve the generated static assets through a minimal NGINX runtime on port 80.

### Acceptance Criteria

- Vite generates the frontend assets.
- NGINX serves the static assets from a slim final stage.
- The final image size is recorded.

### Implementation

The frontend uses a Node.js build stage to install dependencies and compileu the application:

```bash
npm run build
```

The production stage uses NGINX and copies the generated output:

```dockerfile
COPY --from=build /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html
```

This separates the frontend build environment from the runtime used to serve the application

