# INC-003 — War Room Incident Report
**Project:** PostureSec DevSecOps Lab  
**Incident:** INC-003 — Secret/Image Compromised  
**Date:** 17 October 2026  
**Outcome:** Corrected backend deployed; synthetic credential absent from the replacement filesystem and all 10 checked image layers; API health restored.

## 1. Incident Summary

Security monitoring detected credential material associated with the backend container image.

The application continued responding while the incident was active. I investigated the running container and build configuration, contained the affected backend, deployed a corrected image, and verified its filesystem, layers, and application health.

The exercise used a synthetic credential that authenticated to nothing.

