## 8. Remediation

The corrected Dockerfile omitted the training credential and copied only the required application content:

```dockerfile
COPY --from=build /app/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY src/ ./src/
```

I created an additional override, `docker-compose.inc003-remediated.yml`:

```yaml
services:
  backend:
    build:
      dockerfile: Dockerfile.inc003-remediated
```

I rebuilt and replaced only the backend:

```bash
WARROOM_SQUAD=local docker compose -f docker-compose.warroom.yml -f docker-compose.inc003.yml -f docker-compose.inc003-remediated.yml up -d --build --no-deps --force-recreate backend
```

This selected the corrected Dockerfile while preserving the database.

